        "original_id": "6a2cc23d-4f3c-5aa5-bd9f-60929afe8d9a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stephen Edwards, Justin Fleming, Buzz Aldrin\n- Works: Moon Landing\n- Events: American Space Race, Apollo 11 Moon landing\n\nFacts:\n- Buzz Aldrin was born as Edwin Eugene Aldrin Jr. on January 20, 1930, and he is an American engineer and former astronaut.\n- Apollo 11 landed the first humans on the Moon on July 20, 1969.\n- Buzz Aldrin served as the Lunar Module Pilot on Apollo 11, was one of the first two humans to land on the Moon, and became the second person to walk on it.\n- Justin Fleming created the original idea and synopsis for Moon Landing.\n- Moon Landing is a musical with book, lyrics, and music by Stephen Edwards.\n- Moon Landing is based on the American Space Race and the Apollo 11 spaceflight, and it presents the story through the eyes of Buzz Aldrin.",
